menu "Wireless CNC MPG receiver"
    config MPG_ENABLE_MOTION
        bool "Enable experimental wireless CNC jogging"
        default n
        help
            OFF by default. Requires operator-controlled machine interlock,
            verified GRBL UART wiring, independent E-stop, and motion tests.
            Do not enable solely because ESP-NOW pairing succeeds.

    config MPG_TRUSTED_MAC
        string "Manually approved pendant Wi-Fi MAC (AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF)"
        default ""
        depends on MPG_ENABLE_MOTION
        help
            This MAC must be provisioned locally. MAC-only checks are not
            cryptographic authentication; do not use as a safety boundary.
endmenu
